# P0-02 field renames (docs/jellyfin/04-architecture.md §4.2). `Old New`, whole words.
# Every CodingKey/String enum case is pinned to its old raw value first
# (lib/pin_coding_keys.py), so keys on disk and on the wire do not change.
ratingKey               itemID
parentRatingKey         parentID
grandparentRatingKey    grandparentID
librarySectionID        libraryID
